Suggests: gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Description: control centre for Philips Evnia monitors (unofficial offline port)
 Unofficial Linux port of Evnia Precision Center 1.13.0 for Philips Evnia
 monitors, limited to monitor features: picture modes, game settings, input,
 audio, system settings, profiles and Ambiglow lighting over USB-DDC, DDC/CI
 (i2c) and the Ambiglow USB controller.
 .
 The application works entirely offline: firmware updates, cloud accounts,
 downloads and every other online feature are removed, and a network
 kill-switch blocks any remaining outbound request.
 .
 Note: "Reset" of a profile and "Factory reset" in the settings also restore
 the monitor's own factory settings (DDC/CI VCP 0x04), like the Windows
 application. See /usr/share/doc/evnia-precision-center/README.Debian.gz.
